[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:He's Awful!]
[00:00.86]Lesson 71 | 第71课
[00:02.76]He's awful! | 他太讨厌了！
[00:05.10]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.15]How did Pauline answer the telephone at nine o'clock? | 9点钟时，波琳是怎样接电话的？
[00:18.37]What's Ron Marston like, Pauline? | 罗恩·马斯顿是什么样的人，波琳？
[00:23.64]He's awful! | 他太讨厌了！
[00:26.32]He telephoned me four times yesterday and three times the day before yesterday. | 他昨天给我打了4次电话，前天打了3次。
[00:35.90]He telephoned the office yesterday morning and yesterday afternoon. | 他昨天上午和昨天下午都把电话打到办公室去了。
[00:44.96]My boss answered the telephone. | 我的老板接的电话。
[00:49.48]What did your boss say to him? | 你老板对他说什么了？
[00:53.36]He said, 'Pauline is typing letters. | 他说：“波琳正在打字。
[00:58.24]She can't speak to you now!' | 她现在不能跟你讲话！”
[01:01.86]Then I arrived home at six o'clock yesterday evening. | 昨天晚上6点我回到家。
[01:08.24]He telephoned again. | 他又打电话来了。
[01:11.33]But I didn't answer the phone! | 可我没接电话！
[01:15.05]Did he telephone again last night? | 昨晚他又打电话了吗？
[01:19.30]Yes, he did. | 是的，打了。
[01:22.18]He telephoned at nine o'clock. | 他在9点钟打电话来了。
[01:25.93]What did you say to him? | 你对他说了什么？
[01:29.09]I said, 'This is Pauline's mother. | 我说：“我是波琳的妈妈。
[01:33.70]Please don't telephone my daughter again!' | 请不要再给我女儿打电话了！”
[01:38.87]Did he telephone again? | 他又打电话了吗？
[01:41.73]No, he didn't! | 没有！